    "A board from your box: labelled bars, live.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器上的看板：带标签的进度条，实时。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A full-screen board for a phone parked on a desk: clock, room temperature and humidity from a HomeKit sensor, the box's weather, and what needs your attention. The screen stays on and jobs keep running while it shows. Leave it with the small button in the corner. Leave the sensor empty to use the first accessory that has one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "给放在桌上的手机用的全屏看板：时钟、HomeKit 传感器读到的室内温度和湿度、盒子提供的天气，以及需要你处理的事。显示期间屏幕常亮，任务照常执行。点角落的小按钮离开。传感器留空则使用第一个带传感器的配件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A language like zh-CN, or a voice identifier": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语言代码（如 zh-CN）或语音标识符"
          }
        }
      }
    },
