    "For an iPad left plugged in with 白手套 in a small Stage Manager window. While the app is on screen: the connection to the box stays open for as long as it runs, the screen does not lock, and the box gets a heartbeat every 5 minutes. When 白手套 leaves the screen it all stops, and resumes when it comes back. Nothing runs in the background.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "适合插着电、在台前调度小窗口里开着白手套的 iPad。App 在屏幕上时：与服务器的连接一直保持，屏幕不锁定，每 5 分钟向服务器发一次心跳。白手套离开屏幕就全部停止，回到屏幕再继续。后台什么都不运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Four things to open now. Rules, not guesses.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "现在可以打开的四样东西。按规则，不靠猜。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
