    "iOS asks for each permission only once; after “Don't Allow” the switch lives in Settings. Home accessories are added and paired in Apple's Home app, not here: 白手套 sees only what the Home app already has. Unlocking, opening a garage door or disarming always asks you first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 每项权限只问一次；点了“不允许”之后，开关在“设置”里。家居配件在苹果的“家庭”App 里添加和配对，不在这里：白手套只看得到“家庭”App 里已有的配件。开锁、开车库门或解除警戒总会先问你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
